<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Listen, listen, your parents speak to you.</l><l>If you will listen, you’ll know what to do.</l><l>When you obey then you are happy too.</l><l>Listen to your parents speak the whole day through.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
